Recommends: kcontrol-trinity
Suggests: khelpcenter-trinity
Description: systemd manager and journal viewer for TDE
 Graphical tools to administer systemd from the Trinity Desktop
 Environment:
 .
  * Systemd Manager: overview of the system state, start, stop, restart,
    reload, enable, disable and mask system and user services and other
    units, view their status, unit files, properties, dependencies and
    logs, list timers, and change the date and time, time zone and NTP,
    the hostname and the system locale and keyboard.
  * Journal Viewer: read the system or user journal filtered by boot,
    priority, unit, identifier, time and text, follow new messages,
    export them, and perform journal maintenance (vacuum, rotate, flush,
    sync, verify).
  * TDE Control Center modules for both tools.
 .
 Changes to the system are authorized through polkit and carried out by
 a small helper that validates every request.
